{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/294811-a-solar-3e-lifepath-generator","id":294811,"title":"A Solar 3E Lifepath Generator","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-28T08:07:12-07:00","id":294811,"title":"A Solar 3E Lifepath Generator","content":"<a href=\"http://lovethelabyrinth.blogspot.com/2014/10/exalted-3e-lifepathing-your-character.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://lovethelabyrinth.blogspot.com...acter.html?m=1</a><br /> <br /> Try out my proto type Solar Lifepath generator...just use a d10.<br /> <br /> I'd love to hear your input and creations. I'm going to fine tune this and my other Exalted Player/Storyteller tools in the coming weeks.<br /> <br /> I'll post the whole thing here tonight to ease of use if you hate blogger.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1472,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1472-mostlyjoe","user":"Mostlyjoe","date":". 10-28-2014, 12:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1472-mostlyjoe","name":"Mostlyjoe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1472_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-28T09:33:45-07:00","id":294934,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://lovethelabyrinth.blogspot.com/2014/10/exalted-3e-what-is-wrong-with-this.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://lovethelabyrinth.blogspot.com/2014/10/exalted-3e-what-is-wrong-with-this.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a