"title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-28T10:22:11-07:00","id":294979,"title":"","content":"Aye, I could see this being a handy thing. Starting from a blank sheet can be kind of imposing, as can coming up with something on the fly, so a chance at generating some options would be welcome.<br /> <br /> As for any suggestions, maybe some thought to expanding &quot;God Descendant&quot; (and possibly &quot;Beastman,&quot; come to think of it)? It could come to reflect any sort of unusual/supernatural heritage (ghost-blooded, fey-blooded, etc.) with a follow-up roll for the particular type.<br /> <br /> As a sidebar, I like your avatar. Though could you clarify if that's a platypus-person (as I suspect), or someone who's just ducky?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-28T10:32:45-07:00","id":29498