ror (Neverborn)<br /> <br /> Exalted As - Zenith Priest<br /> <br /> Exaltation Fallout - Worshipped by local village (Cult or Followers)<br /> <br /> <br /> 5.<br /> <br /> Ethnic Origin - Southern<br /> <br /> Family Ranking/Background - Criminal<br /> <br /> Family Size - Small Family (1-2 siblings)<br /> <br /> Family Status - Both parents alive and well<br /> <br /> Childhood Events - Lost in wilderness for Many Years (Survival, Animal<br /> <br /> Handling, Archery skills)<br /> <br /> Adult Career - Monk/Priest/Cultist<br /> <br /> Exaltation Trigger - Journey into the depths of 1st Age Ruins<br /> <br /> Exalted As - Zenith Priest<br /> <br /> Exaltation Fallout - A secret to everyone (Maintain mortal cover, merits to<br /> <br /> reflect this.)<br /> <br /> <br /> 6.<br /> <br /> Ethnic Origin - Beastman, South<br /> <br /> Family Ranking/Background - Unknown<br /> <br /> Family Size - Small Family (1-2 siblings)<br /> <br /> Family Status - Suddenly Disappeared!<br /> <br /> Childhood Events - Military Academy (Weapon, War, and Language Skills)<br /> <br /> Adult Career - Rich Layabout<br /> <br /> Exaltation Trigger - Saved a village from attack<br /> <br /> Exalted As - Zenith Priest<br /> <br /> Exaltation Fallout - Hunted by Immaculates (Reputation/Stealth Charms)</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> ... So, I think your tables want me to play a Zenith Priest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-28T15:05:50-07:00","id":295260,"title":"","content":"Kinda funny how the two military backgrounds line up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1472-mostlyjoe","name":"Mostlyjoe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1472_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-28T15:55:50-07:00","id":295347,"title":"","content":"The tables are pretty sure they want both parents alive and well, so that's nice of them. Particularly given the tons of family. The tables also kinda encourage some manner of spiritual pursuit and a run-in with a Lunar Mate. Also, some diverse origins.<br /> <br /> I can easily see some nice ways of getting meat on these skeletons.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I.<br /