es convinced the monster long ago killed that parent and attempts to aid in hunting down the anathema. The character deftly uses the well-built web of contacts and influence pulled together over the years, Lunars the anathema was working on something big, and traces the most likely path for the Wyld Hunt. After shadowing them to these ancient ruins, the character pieces together something the Lunar had not and Exalts as a Night Caste. The Wyld Hunt shifts targets to the surprise Solar, who nearly eats it. The Lunar parent teaches the Wyld Hunt why this was a terrible idea. The Lunar parent commands the new Solar to flee. The Solar does so, leaving the island behind, and almost certain the Lunar is actually the real parent after all. What happens to the Lunar is unknown, but at least one member of the Hunt survived and now pursues the new Sun-Chosen. The Solar begins picking up the pieces on the run.<br /> <br /> 2) <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table_table text_table_table-striped text_table_table-hover\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Ethnic Origins:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Northern (Gethamane, Haslanti Leage, Whitewall)</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Family Background:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Unknown (Family lost, raised in monastery, etc.)</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Family Size:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">A family member in every city. (You just have one of those really huge, slightly inbred, but widely spread families. Consider buying merit to reflect this Influence.)</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Family Status:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Both Parents are alive and well</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Childhood Events:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Lost in Wilderness for Many Years (Survival, Animal Handling, Archery skills)</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Adult Career:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Merchant</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Exaltation Trigger:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Saved a village from attack</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Exalted Template:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Eclipse Diplomat</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Exaltation Fallout:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Stumbled upon Lunar mate (Ally)</td> </tr> </table></div> <br /> The character became lost in the wilderness at a relatively young age, after a mysterious incident involving the rest of the local family. Managing to survive out there and not really knowing what happened or what else to do, the character is eventually found by a group of travelers -- including a relative who had been quite close with the character's family. The character winds a path through several other bits of the expansive family tree, finally settling into a merchant's life. Some years later, a local village is attacked when the merchant company is in town. In part from remembering past dealing with the raiding tribe, the character manages to end things peacefully, saving the town and leaving all parties satisfied, thereby receiving the Sun's blessing. Some time after, helping the merchant company to prosper and smoothing over other disputes on the way, a Lunar approaches the character. The Solar feels a strong connection, and the Lunar reveals a little lead about that strange incident, so many years ago, that had impacted the Lunar as well. The Solar and Lunar begin trying to get to the bottom of it all.<br /> <br /> 3) <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table_table text_table_table-striped text_table_table-hover\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Ethnic Origins:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Southwest (Cinder Isles)</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Family Background:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Administrative/Minor Noble(Realm bureaucrat, mayor, guild factor)</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Family Size:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">A family member in every city. (You just have one of those really huge, slightly inbred, but widely spread families. Consider buying merit to reflect this Influence.)</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Family Status:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Both Parents are alive and well</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Childhood Events:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Long childhood illness that had you bedridden for many years</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Adult Career:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Criminal</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Exaltation Trigger:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Discovered important Lost Lore</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Exalted Template:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Night Spymaster</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_ng-scope text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr text_table_table-hover_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_ng-binding text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Exaltation Fallout:</td> <td class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td text_table_table-hover_td text_table_ng-scope_td\">Supported by Deathlord (Artifacts)</td> </tr> </table></div> <br /> The character's illness would have left a dead child in the streets had one of the character's parents not been fabulously wealthy. They tried everything to help, but nothing worked. At last, they made an otherworldly bargain they likely came to regret. The character grew strong again, but had a responsibility to those who had brought about the recovery, an intermediary agent of a local Deathlord. The character underwent extensive training and became responsible for theft and reconnaissance in service to this agent. The character had misgivings about the purpose behind this. In time, when delivering a report, the character went snooping around, and found out the true nature of the one the intermediary served. Resolving to bring this Deathlord to its end, the character becomes a Solar of the Night Caste. Seizing some important secrets that had evidently been kept from the Deathlord, the new Sun-Chosen finds a path to this Deathlord and exposes the underling's plot. The Deathlord seems to accept this show of loyalty and begins employing the Solar, deciding the Solar's talents will fill different niches than a Deathknight would. The Solar begins carrying out some dirty work in as benign a fashion as possible, seeking to learn as much as possible of the Deathlords, until the opportune moment.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T18:59:22-08:00","id":301678,"title":"","content":"It might be neat if instead of the &quot;Exalted As,&quot; there was a step to roll for (or just pick) your caste, and then each caste had its own separate table of roles/archetypes/whatever to roll on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T21:04:54-08:00","id":301763,"title":"","content":"Ethnic Origins: Beastman North<br /> Family Background: Military<br /> Family Size: Large Family (3-6 siblings)<br /> Family Status: Family Drama: Blighted by Wyld taint<br /> Childhood Events: Favorite of Demon<br /> Adult Career: Criminal<br /> Exaltation Trigger: Drawn into conflict with Realm over Local worship<br /> Exalted Template: Night Spymaster<br /> Exaltation Fallout: Drawn by dreams to Lost Manse (Manse)<br /> <br /> The funny thing is that I actually have a character sorta like this in another game.<br /> <br /> Also, I created a random island generator awhile back. Would anyone be interested in seeing it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T21:13:01-08:00","id":301767,"title":"","content":"By all means, please share.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-04T19:24:42-08:00","id":302859,"title":"","content":"We can start a Exalted random event generator thread too!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1472-mostlyjoe","name":"Mostlyjoe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1472_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T01:07:46-08:00","id":304269,"title":"","content":"Exalt: <br /> Ethnic Origin: 1 - Realm<br /> Family Ranking: 8 - Noble<br /> Family Size: 4 - Giant Family<br /> Family Status: 5 - Parents both alive<br /> Childhood Events: 3 - Nearly killed of - 7 - Demon<br /> Adult Career: 10 - Hunter/Explorer/Scavenger lord<br /> Exaltation Trigger: 5 - Drawn into conflict with the realm - 7 - Lost artifacts<br /> Exalted Template: Dawn strategist<br /> Exaltation Fallout: 9 - Awakened to a deeper understanding of the universe<br /> <br /> First village he/she goes to:<br /> Village size: 6 - Small city<br /> What's wrong: 6 - Fair Folk, the 5 - Realm and finally 4 - Exalted<br /> They are doing what: 7 - Ruled by fair folk, 9 - Desires the aid of the realm, 3 - Is the base of operation for an Exalt.<br /> This could be an interesting story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://jaxushomebrew.blogspot.ie/2016/06/introduction-site-map-and-catalogue.html\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew blog</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1291-mr-jaxus","name":"Mr.Jaxus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"379"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-09T09:58:12-08:00","id":307533,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/294811-a-solar-3e-lifepath-generator?p=301767#post301767\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By all means, please share.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had to go look through some of my old notes, but I've posted it with examples, here:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/307468-random-island-location-generator-for-exalted\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/307468-random-island-location-generator-for-exalted\"> Random Island/Location Generator for Exalted. - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/307468-random-island-location-generator-for-exalted\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/307468-random-island-location-generator-for-exalted </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> So, I originally designed this random generator to spark ideas for me when I was running a 2e game set in the West. I found that rolling 2d10 three times usually gave me enough to create something nifty. I made it to be non-specific intentionally, to better serve as an idea generator. Which means that, if </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-09T10:10:41-08:00","id":307556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mostlyjoe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/294811-a-solar-3e-lifepath-generator?p=294976#post294976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have ideas for Exalted fasion, career events, and 1st Age flashback generators.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like the idea of the last one especially. One of the things I was thinking for when I run a campaign was to put some pre-generated memories on cards, and have players who like the idea randomly draw some.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2160-elemental","name":"Elemental","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2160_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"412"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T09:38:45-08:00","id":309234,"title":"","content":"The Random 1st Age Flashback Generator! <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://lovethelabyrinth.blogspot.com/2014/11/the-random-1st-age-flashback-generator.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://lovethelabyrinth