ass=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morangias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/294811-a-solar-3e-lifepath-generator?p=310516#post310516\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've always loved these charts in CP2020, and I definitely love having them for Exalted. Great tools for any ST who wants to populate the setting with Exalts quickly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you very much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1472-mostlyjoe","name":"Mostlyjoe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1472_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-12T17:32:19-08:00","id":310753,"title":"","content":"Ah! Let's take the whole thing for a spin and see what we get!<br /> <br /> <br /> Ethnic Origin: Southwest, Cinder Isles<br /> <br /> Family Background: God Descendant<br /> <br /> Family Size: Small Family (1-2 siblings)<br /> <br /> Family Status: Both Parents are alive and well<br /> <br /> Childhood Events: Favorite of Exalt<br /> <br /> Adult Career: Military<br /> <br /> Exaltation Trigger: Saved a village from attack<br /> <br /> Exalted As: Dawn Strategist<br /> <br /> Exaltation Fallout: A secret to everyone (Maintain mortal cover, merits to reflect this)<br /> <br /> <br /> Primary Costume Piece: High Collar Uniform with Demon unit symbol<br /> <br /> Secondary Costume Piece: Flowing Cape/Trench Coat<br /> <br /> Primary Accessory: Mask (Nature Animal/Plant)<br /> <br /> Secondary Accessory: Bells/Mirror Adornments<br /> <br /> Colors: White/Moonsilver Primary, Green/Jade Highlights<br /> <br /> Hair Style/Color: Military Top-Knot, Indigo<br /> <br /> <br /> And finally, is this person male or female? Evens says woman, odds says man. Roll = 1, so he's a man.<br /> <br /> Very interesting...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-12T18:05:57-08:00","id":310769,"title":"","content":"Wow. That worked out pretty damn well <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878\">Prometheus878</a>.</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1472-mostlyjoe","name":"Mostlyjoe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1472_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-12T18:46:56-08:00","id":310793,"title":"","content":"Indeed! I just wish I had the corebook so I can actually stat up some characters.<br /> <br /> On that note, what are you planning to do regarding these random generators once the core comes out? These are <i>fantastic</i>, but I get the feeling Ex3 will give us so many cool options we may <i>have</i> to roll randomly for them, just to be able to pick between them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-13T10:38:08-08:00","id":311449,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/294811-a-solar-3e-lifepath-generator?p=310793#post310793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Indeed! I just wish I had the corebook so I can actually stat up some characters.<br /> <br /> On that note, what are you planning to do regarding these random generators once the core comes out? These are <i>fantastic</i>, but I get the feeling Ex3 will give us so many cool options we may <i>have</i> to roll randomly for them, just to be able to pick between them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I plan on updating them post book drop.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1472-mostlyjoe","name":"Mostlyjoe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1472_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-13T10:50:24-08:00","id":311468,"title":"","content":"There are some very nice things in here. It should probably wait until the book is out, but aids to randomly generate artifact weaponry and other equipment would be cool, too. &quot;Before rolling for a magical material, roll a d10; on a 1-6, roll for only one magical material; on a 7-9, roll for two to alloy, rolling again for duplicates; on a 10, roll for three to alloy, rolling again for duplicates,&quot; say, before going for various properties (aesthetic and associative) by magical material, history, origin, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-13T21:03:00-08:00","id":311903,"title":"","content":"Let me try...<br /> <br /> Ethnic Origins: Beastman North<br /> <br /> Family Background: Noble (Realm or Threshold)<br /> <br /> Family Size: Single Child (No close relations)<br /> <br /> Family Status: Family Drama: Murdered Both<br /> <br /> Childhood Events: Occult Apprenticeship (Occult, Lore, and Language Skills)<br /> <br /> Adult Career: Monk/Priest/Cultist<br /> <br /> Exaltation Trigger: Journey into depths of Underworld<br /> <br /> Exalted Template: Zenith Monster Hunter<br /> <br /> Exaltation Fallout: Supported by Deathlord (Artifacts)<br /> <br /> And how will they dress?<br /> <br /> Primary Costume Piece: Exposed Chest (Bare/Bandage Wrapped)<br /> <br /> Secondary Costume Piece: Cummerbund/Heavy Belt<br /> <br /> Primary Accessory: Long Scarf/Obi (Belly Wrap)<br /> <br /> Secondary Accessory: Spectacles (Functional/Jewelers)<br /> <br /> Colors: Indigo/Starmetal primary, Black/Soulsteel highlights<br /> <br /> Hair Style/Color: Long loose/bound, Orange<br /> <br /> <br /> I can picture them already... And I like what I'm seeing.<br /> <br /> I may save this somewhere and play them when 3E hits.<br /> <br /> I'm also starting to suspect my dice are channeling abbysal essence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Currently Playing:</b> <i>A large, mixed splat game of <b>CofD</b>.</i> <b>As:</b> Seraph du Salomon, Voice on the concordance. Unsubtle man reluctantly participating in the business of Magi. Awakening 2E homebrew <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1338514-house-du-salomon-a-proximus-dynasty?_=1569864567692\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...=1569864567692</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","name":"Gryphon's Feather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2598_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"215"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T21:26:32-08:00","id":313478,"title":"","content":"Urs Reupke of Anathema has written an early Android based random roller for the generators. He's updating it as he gets time and I'll be feeding him new elements from my blog he'll add in.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__ur